Package: saira
Title: Biodiversity Data Standardization to Darwin Core
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Rog\u00E9rio", "Nunes Oliveira", email = "rogerio@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny application for standardizing biodiversity datasets to the 
    Darwin Core standard. Provides bilingual interface (PT-BR/EN-US) with tools 
    for data validation, column mapping, and taxonomic verification. Designed 
    for use with SiBBr (Sistema de Informa\u00E7\u00E3o sobre a Biodiversidade Brasileira).
